<a class="btn btn-small gear-planner-button-container-link fa fa-link" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/gear-planner/druid/night-elf/BgFQFfUDIyEyMiAQNTEgMAMTUR8gNQAB8B8wMDFuZ3cxMW5ndDIxenB2MzFyZzI0MXJmejUxcmcxgUDIYAEI_wChpCCctwIgxfoAnMKDIMhjAPOwAJy3hWDF4ADG3QCctyCct0CctwZgxhMAnLcgnLdAnLeHQMhhAOylAJy3IJy3iEDFrwDW6ACctyCct4kg1TQA8zAAnLeKIMhfAPkaAJy3CyDFvgCctwwgxOQAnLcNALfwDgDEvI8gxSIAujgAnLeQQMjoAPxDAJy3IJy3EgDFGA" style="margin-left:5px;float:right">Link</a>
