<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>The 25-man Heroic version (Item Level 277) of the Tier 10 helm is individually the BiS option for Phase 4 just due to its stat allocation, making it even better once the 4-piece bonus is taken into account. The next best option individually is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51427/wrathful-gladiators-dragonhide-helm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_126.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrathful Gladiator's Dragonhide Helm</span></a> from Arena Season 8, but as mentioned earlier in this guide, both the 264 and 251 Item Level versions of the Tier 10 helm will outperform it if equipping them allows you to activate the 4pT10 bonus.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>.<br/>If you are not an Engineer, then the best alternative helm enchant is <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44150/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> from Revered <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1106/argent-crusade">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Argent Crusade</span></a> reputation. When tanking <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44137/arcanum-of-the-frosty-soul">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_frozencore.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Frosty Soul</span></a> is an extremely efficient Frost Resistance swap that will provide higher overall survivability on that encounter.<div class="pad"></div>
