<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50646/cultists-bloodsoaked-spaulders">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_112.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cultist's Bloodsoaked Spaulders</span></a> off Heroic <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36855/lady-deathwhisper">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Deathwhisper</span></a> are individually the best Phase 4 tanking option since they contain a second gem socket (equivalent to 30 additional Stamina). However, either the 277, 264, or even 251 Item Level versions of the Tier 10 shoulders will provide much higher value in practice if equipping them allows you to complete the 4pT10 bonus. Nevertheless, if your raid team is able to down Heroic <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36855/lady-deathwhisper">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lady Deathwhisper</span></a> early on in the phase, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50646/cultists-bloodsoaked-spaulders">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_112.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cultist's Bloodsoaked Spaulders</span></a> will still provide a hefty upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45245/shoulderpads-of-the-intruder">
