<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>The <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> reward <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50466/sentinels-winter-cloak">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sentinel's Winter Cloak</span></a> will be the highest survivability tanking cloak for Feral Druids in Phase 4 due to its inflated Armor allocation relative to alternative options. Even though Bonus Armor (or "green" armor) on cloaks in WotLK does not scale with the multipliers from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=9634/dire-bear-form">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_racial_bearform.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dire Bear Form</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=16931/thick-hide">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pelt_bear_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thick Hide</span></a>, and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33856/survival-of-the-fittest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_enrage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Survival of the Fittest</span></a>, it is nevertheless a highly efficient tanking stat for bears at ICC gear levels, since the amount of EHP added per Armor scales with the player's raw health pool. For content that is already on farm, <img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/horde.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47546/sylvanas-cunning">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sylvanas' Cunning</span></a> /<wbr/> <img alt="" class="no-border" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/guide/images/27798.png"/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47545/vereesas-dexterity">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_16.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vereesa's Dexterity</span></a> from Phase 3 is the most efficient offensive swap that can be made in the cloak slot for boosting your DPS/<wbr/>TPS without giving up too much survivability.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Cloak Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47672/enchant-cloak-mighty-armor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Mighty Armor</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=55002/flexweave-underlay">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flexweave Underlay</span></a>
<br/>When tanking <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44483/enchant-cloak-superior-frost-resistance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Superior Frost Resistance</span></a> is an extremely efficient Frost Resistance swap that will provide higher overall survivability on that encounter.<div class="pad"></div>
