<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>As mentioned in the Emblems section earlier in this guide, the chest slot is the best place to use an off-set item when optimizing for the 4-piece <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-845/lasherweave-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Lasherweave Battlegear</span></a> set bonus, simply because <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50656/ikfiruss-sack-of-wonder">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ikfirus's Sack of Wonder</span></a> offers the largest individual upgrade over the corresponding 277 Item Level Tier 10 piece across all slots. Even if you will exclusively be raiding ICC on 10-man Heroic or 25-man Normal difficulty, the chest slot will remain the optimal place for a non-Tier item, since the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_frostemblem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Frost</span></span></a> reward <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50972/shadow-seekers-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_22.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadow Seeker's Tunic</span></a> is similarly a larger upgrade over <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=51141/sanctified-lasherweave-raiment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_leather_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sanctified Lasherweave Raiment</span></a> than any other off-piece.<br/>
<br/>Note that when tanking <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=43590/polar-vest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Polar Vest</span></a> is an extremely efficient Frost Resistance swap that will provide higher overall survivability than even 277 Item Level alternatives from ICC.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38376/heavy-borean-armor-kit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavy Borean Armor Kit</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=60692/enchant-chest-powerful-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Powerful Stats</span></a>
