<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>As mentioned earlier in the guide, the wrist slot is the only slot with a pure survivability upgrade for Feral tanks from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4987/the-ruby-sanctum">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Ruby Sanctum</span></a> relative to alternatives from <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> and prior raids: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> off <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=39863/halion">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halion</span></a> on 25-man Heroic difficulty. However, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50670/toskks-maximized-wristguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Toskk's Maximized Wristguards</span></a> remain an efficient balanced option that will provide higher DPS/<wbr/>TPS than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> at only a minor survivability cost.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57690/fur-lining-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fur Lining - Stamina</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>.<br/>If you are not a Leatherworker, then the best alternative bracer enchant is <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=62256/enchant-bracers-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracers - Major Stamina</span></a>. Note that even when tanking <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36853/sindragosa">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sindragosa</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=57690/fur-lining-stamina">
