<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>Similar to the shoulder slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50675/aldrianas-gloves-of-secrecy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_79.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aldriana's Gloves of Secrecy</span></a> are the best Phase 4 tanking gloves individually due to their second gem socket, but any version of the Tier 10 gloves will outperform them if you are using the Tier gloves to complete your 4-piece set bonus. Just like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50646/cultists-bloodsoaked-spaulders">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_112.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cultist's Bloodsoaked Spaulders</span></a>, however, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50675/aldrianas-gloves-of-secrecy">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_79.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Aldriana's Gloves of Secrecy</span></a> are still an excellent early upgrade to target when gearing up for Heroic Lich King progression, since <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=36627/rotface">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Rotface</span></a> is one of the easier Heroic bosses to get down and it will take about 4 weeks to obtain enough Emblems for 4pT10.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Glove Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63770/reticulated-armor-webbing">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reticulated Armor Webbing</span></a>, requires <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>.<br/>On farm content, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54999/hyperspeed-accelerators">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hyperspeed Accelerators</span></a> can be used as an offensive swap for higher DPS/<wbr/>TPS. If you are not an Engineer, then the best alternative glove enchant is <a class="q2 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=38376/heavy-borean-armor-kit">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heavy Borean Armor Kit</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
