<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50682/bile-encrusted-medallion">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_icecrownnecklaceb.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bile-Encrusted Medallion</span></a> is a direct stat upgrade on all fronts from the Phase 3 BiS necklace <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47466/legionnaires-gorget">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legionnaire's Gorget</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47133/the-arbiters-muse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_44.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Arbiter's Muse</span></a>, making it the natural choice for bears in Phase 4 when optimizing for survivability. However, when tanking farm content that you over-gear, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50728/lanathels-chain-of-flagellation">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lana'thel's Chain of Flagellation</span></a> is a surprisingly efficient offensive swap option, since Expertise Rating and Armor Penetration Rating are both high value DPS stats for bears at Phase 4 gear levels.<div class="pad"></div>
