<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="idols-for-feral-druid-tank-phase-4">Idols for Feral Druid Tank Phase 4</h4>In Phase 4, Feral tanks will finally be able to replace <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45509/idol-of-the-corruptor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_strife.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Idol of the Corruptor</span></a> from Phase 2-3, since the new <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=341/emblem-of-frost">
